{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo version:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/05190439eac86c300774f81581e50bb0.avif?t=1758042274\" width=1170 height=880 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, medical accidents are legion, but fortunately, the dead don't talk. All that matters is profitability, and to achieve this, management is willing to throw you in at the deep end, as long as patients flock in large numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an amateur doctor with no experience or qualifications, you find yourself in France in 1999, immersed in a job that requires constant mental effort:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checking</strong>, <strong>examining</strong>, <strong>diagnosing</strong>, and <strong>prescribing</strong> are all tasks that you will learn on the job, for better or for worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Director so aptly puts it: \u201c<i>You can't make an omelet without breaking eggs.</i>\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/15aba0e20236aa594f1cb1ea8bd6ed27.avif?t=1758042274\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/10c9dfcc859d6ac7bc872bf8d2d9a7f1.poster.avif?t=1758042274\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/10c9dfcc859d6ac7bc872bf8d2d9a7f1.webm?t=1758042274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/10c9dfcc859d6ac7bc872bf8d2d9a7f1.mp4?t=1758042274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every patient is a potential fraudster, you have been warned!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >False name, expired card, no insurance? It is up to YOU, as a doctor and the last line of defense, to prevent undesirable individuals from accessing healthcare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Management is watching you...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/f70fd04af6ce53c55486482e186ab183.avif?t=1758042274\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/5a4d3db3737d8554891005937603353e.poster.avif?t=1758042274\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/5a4d3db3737d8554891005937603353e.webm?t=1758042274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/5a4d3db3737d8554891005937603353e.mp4?t=1758042274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put away your rudimentary tools\u2014medicine is serious business!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, management isn't leaving you defenseless. As a good 20th-century doctor at the cutting edge of medical technology, you'll have access to real diagnostic weapons made in France. Among others:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rechargeable battery flashlight</strong> (<i>no less</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A thermometer that beeps</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intra-aural blood pressure monitor</strong> (<i>beware of head explosions</i>)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/ebb2f28d7293141fc6b8d99934bf63b7.avif?t=1758042274\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/777f327421cc1cc6fedce63463e0b335.poster.avif?t=1758042274\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/777f327421cc1cc6fedce63463e0b335.webm?t=1758042274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/777f327421cc1cc6fedce63463e0b335.mp4?t=1758042274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The right treatment for every patient.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a range of illnesses, each more absurd than the last, you will need to identify the correct symptoms and make a diagnosis that will affect your paycheck no matter what happens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get it wrong, or you may find the unfortunate patient in the obituary section of the next day's newspaper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOTE:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a demo limited to 5 days of gameplay. It does not contain a real scenario, but each day brings its share of new diseases, new tools, and difficulty levels that will gradually intensify your experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final version will of course be longer (survive 30 days) with a storyline combining absurdity, moral dilemmas, and multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any comments, the comment section is there to help improve the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I would be very grateful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973610?t=1758042274","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973610?t=1758042274","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/8cbc5e45f569b352124b703fb72616aa81950ce1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758042274","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/8cbc5e45f569b352124b703fb72616aa81950ce1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758042274","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo version:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/05190439eac86c300774f81581e50bb0.avif?t=1758042274\" width=1170 height=880 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, medical accidents are legion, but fortunately, the dead don't talk. All that matters is profitability, and to achieve this, management is willing to throw you in at the deep end, as long as patients flock in large numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an amateur doctor with no experience or qualifications, you find yourself in France in 1999, immersed in a job that requires constant mental effort:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checking</strong>, <strong>examining</strong>, <strong>diagnosing</strong>, and <strong>prescribing</strong> are all tasks that you will learn on the job, for better or for worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Director so aptly puts it: \u201c<i>You can't make an omelet without breaking eggs.</i>\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/15aba0e20236aa594f1cb1ea8bd6ed27.avif?t=1758042274\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/10c9dfcc859d6ac7bc872bf8d2d9a7f1.poster.avif?t=1758042274\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/10c9dfcc859d6ac7bc872bf8d2d9a7f1.webm?t=1758042274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/10c9dfcc859d6ac7bc872bf8d2d9a7f1.mp4?t=1758042274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every patient is a potential fraudster, you have been warned!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >False name, expired card, no insurance? It is up to YOU, as a doctor and the last line of defense, to prevent undesirable individuals from accessing healthcare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Management is watching you...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/f70fd04af6ce53c55486482e186ab183.avif?t=1758042274\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/5a4d3db3737d8554891005937603353e.poster.avif?t=1758042274\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/5a4d3db3737d8554891005937603353e.webm?t=1758042274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/5a4d3db3737d8554891005937603353e.mp4?t=1758042274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put away your rudimentary tools\u2014medicine is serious business!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, management isn't leaving you defenseless. As a good 20th-century doctor at the cutting edge of medical technology, you'll have access to real diagnostic weapons made in France. Among others:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rechargeable battery flashlight</strong> (<i>no less</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A thermometer that beeps</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intra-aural blood pressure monitor</strong> (<i>beware of head explosions</i>)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/ebb2f28d7293141fc6b8d99934bf63b7.avif?t=1758042274\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/777f327421cc1cc6fedce63463e0b335.poster.avif?t=1758042274\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/777f327421cc1cc6fedce63463e0b335.webm?t=1758042274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/extras/777f327421cc1cc6fedce63463e0b335.mp4?t=1758042274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The right treatment for every patient.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a range of illnesses, each more absurd than the last, you will need to identify the correct symptoms and make a diagnosis that will affect your paycheck no matter what happens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get it wrong, or you may find the unfortunate patient in the obituary section of the next day's newspaper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOTE:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a demo limited to 5 days of gameplay. It does not contain a real scenario, but each day brings its share of new diseases, new tools, and difficulty levels that will gradually intensify your experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final version will of course be longer (survive 30 days) with a storyline combining absurdity, moral dilemmas, and multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any comments, the comment section is there to help improve the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I would be very grateful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Nuclear Rabbits"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3954850","name":"Prescribe and Pray"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973610/3590d3ddd63e1f9800b547fce4813b6d5aa15d84/header.jpg?t=1758042274","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Prescribe and Pray Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 7/8/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Nuclear Rabbits"],"ratings":